# r1113 chunk 4, boot A: ONE boot, group A superflat creative (ground: grass y -61, air from y -60), level r1113c4a.
# Rows: SQ-FDI-01, -02, -03, -05 (static half), SQ-GAP-01, -02, -04 to -09, SQ-BREED-02 (server half), -03 (moved to A:
# superflat has no wild flowers, so a bee can only find the placed one), SQ-NSM-01 (static half), SQ-CDNS-11 (dish half),
# SQ-HCS-07, -12, SQ-FLR-03, -04, -05, SQ-RDB-03 (server parts of SQ-RD-08, -11, -22, -24, SQ-RDX-01, -03 to -12, -14),
# SQ-RDB-02 (last: /dumpall).
#
# SQ-GAP is marked HOLD in the queue ("only after the Common suite is finished"): SQ-CGE ran 2026-11-08 with no FAIL
# or PARTIAL left in any later run doc, so the hold condition is met. Skip the SQ-GAP rows (--rows) if the orchestrator
# keeps the hold.
#
# Setup (OUT = scratch dir, srv = OUT/srv, INST = instance root):
#   bash $INST/tools/scratch_query/prep_srv.sh OUT r1113c4a A spawn-animals=true
#     (spawn-animals=true: summoned crows, squid and bees are discarded otherwise; dev jars swapped in by prep_srv:
#      Common 11-12 20:46, Compat 11-12 20:46, Brewing 11-12 20:47, Delight 11-11 16:52, Engineering 11-10 23:06)
#   cp ~/.local/share/atlauncher/downloads/SoL-Carrot-1.19.2-1.14.0.jar srv/mods/     (SQ-FDI: Carrot jar, srv only,
#      never the instance mods/; srv/defaultconfigs/solcarrot-server.toml comes from the instance defaultconfigs/)
#   python3 $INST/tools/scratch_query/qrun.py toml srv/config/loadingprotection-common.toml '"Loading Protection Configuration"' protectionDuration 1
#   probes into srv/kubejs/server_scripts/ (zz_zq_probe.js is copied by prep_srv.sh):
#     cp $INST/tools/scratch_query/zc4_probe.js      zz_zc4_probe.js     (/zc4, new for r1113)
#     cp $INST/tools/scratch_query/hh_crow_probe.js  zz_hh_crow_probe.js (/zhh3: tame, tally, items, inv, throw, sneak, block, nests)
#     cp $INST/tools/scratch_query/zact_probe.js     zz_zact_probe.js    (/zact break)
#     cp $INST/tools/fungi_probe/zcount.js           zz_count.js         (/zcount)
#     cp $INST/tools/fungi_probe/ztrades.js          zz_trades.js        (/ztrades)
# If the boot fails on the Carrot jar: remove it, reboot, and run with --rows excluding SQ-FDI-*.
# FRESH boot: kjsexpect / kjsreject rows come before any /reload or /dumpall (SQ-RDB-02 is the last row).
# Areas (z 40000 lane): nests 40000, crow box 40100, Create rigs 40200-40260, egg pools 40300, planting 40400,
# dish 40500, cakes 40600, bees 40700, Rustic 40800-40900. Bots: one name per row.
# Id fixes against the old rows (11-09/11-10 namespace moves): creativeengineering:glowing_calamari(_slice) and the
# roasted_bell_pepper_slice tag -> creativedelight:; SQ-RDX-01's "Rustic Delight upstream data" line is gone since the
# bake (SQ-RDB-01), so only the error rejects stay.
pace 2

## SQ-FDI-01 | Carrot Edition loads, no parse error, Food Dictionary item
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject (?i)Failed to parse.*solcarrot|solcarrot.*(exception|could not)
shell grep -nE "solcarrot|Failed to parse" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-250 | head -20; ls mods | grep -i carrot
> zq item solcarrot:food_book
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
expect \[zq\] item solcarrot:food_book: class
